<title>USA: Tripos acquires distribution rights.</title>
<headline>Tripos acquires distribution rights.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tripos Inc said Monday it acquired exclusive worldwide distribution rights to new software technology, DiverseSolutions.</p>
<p>The technology provides fast chemical compound selection and database comparison for life science research, Tripos said.</p>
<p>It was developed by Professor Robert Pearlman and colleagues at the University of Texas in Austin, it added.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
